WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.969
&gt;&gt; MISTER PRESIDENT, YOU'VE
OBVIOUSLY HEARD THERE'S ALL

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:07.907
THESE ARTICLES BEING WRITTEN IN
THESE FOREIGN POLICY ANALYSTS

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:12.078
WHO ARE SAYING ISN'T IT ENOUGH
ALREADY FOR YOU?

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:14.747
SHOULD YOU GO TO THE
NEGOTIATING TABLE?

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:25.658
ARE YOU FEELING ANY PRESSURE
YOU GO TO THE NEGOTIATION TABLE?

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:28.828
&gt;&gt; LOOK, THEY DON'T WANT THIS
WAR TO BE FINISHED.

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:33.566
NOW, BEFORE HAVING ANY FATIGUE,
EVERYONE HAS TO UNDERSTAND THAT

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:39.506
IT'S ONLY THE KREMLIN, AND ONLY
ONE PERSON, THE HEAD OF THE

00:00:39.506 --> 00:00:41.774
RUSSIAN FEDERATION, WHO IS NOT
TIRED OF THE WAR.

00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:44.777
HE MIGHT BE TIRED OF LIFE IN
PRINCIPLE BECAUSE OF HIS AGE,

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:48.214
BUT HE'S DEFINITELY NOT TIRED
OF THE WAR.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:51.851
THIS PERSON AND THE RUSSIAN
POLITICAL AND MILITARY

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:54.954
LEADERSHIP NEED A PAUSE.
BELIEVE ME, THEY CAN FEEL IT.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:58.858
THEY'VE BEGUN TO FIELD THE
EFFECT OF THESE ACTIONS.

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:02.428
THEY HAVE BEGUN TO FEEL
DISSATISFACTION IN THEIR

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:07.066
SOCIETY.
THIS PERSON AND ALL OF THEM ARE

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:10.603
AFRAID OF OUR SOCIETY.
THESE PEOPLE UNFORTUNATELY HAVE

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:14.007
NO VOICE.
BECAUSE IF THEY WEREN'T AFRAID

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:17.277
OF GOING TO THE STREETS, THEY
WOULD EXERT PRESSURE.

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:22.782
THIS IS WHAT THE RUSSIAN
LEADERSHIP IS A PARADE OF.

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:27.420
AND THEN FOR OUR PART, WE SAY
PLEASE RESPECT OUR PRINCIPLES

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:31.991
OF UN CHARTER.
PLEASE RESPECT OUR TERRITORIAL

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:34.994
INTEGRITY.
PLEASE RESPECT OUR RIGHT, OUR

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:36.529
FREEDOM, OUR LAND, AND OUR
CHOICE.

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:40.266
THAT'S IT.
SO THIS WORD FATIGUE IS A BIG

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:43.236
WORD.
YOU CAN'T GET FATIGUED.

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:46.372
IT'S TOO EARLY FOR ALL OF US TO
GET FATIGUED.

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:52.045
BUT THE WIND RUSSIA TRULY WANTS
PEACE, WE WILL DEFINITELY FEEL

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:55.081
IT AND SEE THAT.
YOU KNOW, YOU CAN'T WISH FOR

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:57.483
PEACE WITH WORDS ALONE.
WORDS ARE NOT ENOUGH.

00:01:57.483 --> 00:02:03.323
STOP THE WAR, WITHDRAW FROM THE
TERRITORY, STOP KILLING PEOPLE.

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:07.193
START REIMBURSING THE DAMAGES
INFLICTED ON OUR COUNTRY.

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:09.696
CRIMINALS MUST BE PROSECUTED SO
WORDS ARE NOT ENOUGH.

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:15.368
&gt;&gt; DO YOU STILL STAND BY WHAT
YOU SAID A FEW MONTHS AGO?

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:17.370
THAT YOU WOULD NOT COULD --
NEGOTIATE WITH VLADIMIR PUTIN?

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:23.343
&gt;&gt; HIS PROPOSAL HAS NO
SUBSTANCE WITH REGARDS OF

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:26.012
ENDING THE WAR.
OTHER THAN THE ULTIMATUMS, I'VE

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:28.848
NOT HEARD ANYTHING FROM THE
CURRENT PRESIDENT OF THE

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:31.817
RUSSIAN FEDERATION.
STARTING FOR THE 24TH OF

00:02:31.817 --> 00:02:34.921
FEBRUARY, THERE HAVE BEEN ONLY
ULTIMATUMS.

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:39.692
DENAZIFICATION, THE
NATIONALIZATION, EVERY ISSUE

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:43.730
THEY RAISE STARTS WITH THE.
THEY ALWAYS WANT TO DEPRIVE US

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:48.001
OF SOMETHING VIOLENTLY ON OUR
OWN LAND.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:52.538
SO I SAID I'M NOT GOING TO TALK
TO THIS PERSON IF THIS PERSON

00:02:52.538 --> 00:02:56.809
CONDUCTS THESE SHAM REFERENDUMS
AND RECOGNIZES ALL OF THESE

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.812
SHAM AUTHORITIES THAT THEY SET
UP AS LEGAL.

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:04.584
WE SAID THIS CLEARLY.
I SAID IF THEY DO THAT, THEN

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:08.688
THIS MEANS THEY DON'T RESPECT
OUR PEOPLE, OUR SOVEREIGNTY,

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:14.427
OUR RIGHTS AND OUR FREEDOMS.
WHAT IS THERE TO TALK TO THEM

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:16.663
ABOUT?
BUT I HAVE NOT CLOSED THE DOOR.

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:19.432
I SAID WE WOULD BE READY TO
TALK TO RUSSIA, BUT WITH A

00:03:19.432 --> 00:03:23.136
DIFFERENT RUSSIA.
ONE THAT IS TRULY READY FOR

00:03:23.136 --> 00:03:26.072
PEACE.
ONE THAT IS READY TO RECOGNIZE

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:31.377
THAT THEY ARE OCCUPIERS.
READY TO REIMBURSE OUR PEOPLE.

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:35.148
THAT'S NOT ABOUT MONEY.
THEY NEED TO RETURN EVERYTHING,

00:03:35.148 --> 00:03:39.719
LAND, RIGHTS, FREEDOM, MONEY,
AND MOST IMPORTANTLY JUSTICE.

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:42.722
TO THE PARENTS WHO LOST THEIR
CHILDREN.

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:45.658
MONEY IS NOT ENOUGH.
IT'S NOT A PRIORITY.

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:51.097
BRING BACK JUSTICE.
AND SO FAR, I HAVE NOT HEARD

00:03:51.097 --> 00:03:53.866
STATEMENTS LIKE THAT FROM THE
RUSSIAN FEDERATION, EITHER FROM

00:03:53.866 --> 00:04:00.139
PUTIN OR FROM ANYONE ELSE.
&gt;&gt; THE ISSUE OF NATO IS VERY --

00:04:00.139 --> 00:04:01.074
--
A VERY-CHARGED ONE.

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:05.311
I ASSUME YOU ARE PUTTING NATO
TO THE FUTURE, BUT ARE YOU

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:10.583
TRYING TO GET, ARE YOU
CONFIDENT YOU WILL GET SECURITY

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:15.388
GUARANTEES?
&gt;&gt; UKRAINE NEEDS SECURITY

00:04:15.388 --> 00:04:17.957
GUARANTEES.
THE WORLD NEEDS SECURITY

00:04:17.957 --> 00:04:21.293
GUARANTEES FOR UKRAINE, BECAUSE
STABILITY DEPENDS ON IT.

00:04:21.293 --> 00:04:23.796
AND THIS RELATES TO THE 50 YOU
MENTIONED.

00:04:23.796 --> 00:04:27.967
AFTER VICTORY, AFTER PEACE, WE
DON'T WANT TO COME BACK TO THE

00:04:27.967 --> 00:04:31.337
SAME SITUATION.
BUT IT MIGHT HAPPEN.

00:04:31.337 --> 00:04:37.009
THE CURRENT MILITARY AND
POLITICAL LEADERSHIP OF RUSSIA

00:04:37.009 --> 00:04:40.480
AND ONE FORM OF ANOTHER, JUST
LIKE THE MIDST AGREEMENT, OR

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:43.249
SOME OTHER AGREEMENTS.
THEY NEEDED A PAUSE.

00:04:43.249 --> 00:04:47.220
THEY WILL GATHER UP THEIR
STRENGTH, MONEY, WEAPONS.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:50.990
THEY WILL GET READY.
THEY WOULD LAY OUT THE

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:55.294
INFORMATION FOR THEIR OWN
SOCIETY, AND WHEN ALL OF THAT

00:04:55.294 --> 00:04:58.331
HAS BEEN PREPARED, THEY START
THE OFFENSIVE.

00:04:58.331 --> 00:05:03.436
BECAUSE THERE IS ONLY ONE GOAL,
TO DESTROY OUR INDEPENDENCE.

00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:08.975
THERE'S NO OTHER GOAL IN PLACE.
THAT IS WHY WE NEED SECURITY

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:11.444
GUARANTEES.
WE ABSOLUTELY WANT THAT.

00:05:11.444 --> 00:05:14.313
AND WE BELIEVE WE HAVE ALREADY
DEMONSTRATED OUR FORCES

00:05:14.313 --> 00:05:18.017
CAPABILITY TO THE WORLD BY THE
LEVEL OF TRAINING, BY THE

00:05:18.017 --> 00:05:19.719
RESILIENCE OF OUR DEFENSE
SYSTEM.

00:05:19.719 --> 00:05:23.289
I BELIEVE THAT WE ARE AT THE
SAME LEVEL AS NATO MEMBER

00:05:23.289 --> 00:05:27.660
COUNTRIES AT LEAST.
AND I THINK IT WOULD BE FAIR IF

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:31.764
WE WERE IN THE SAME SECURITY
CIRCLE, AND SAME SECURITY

00:05:31.764 --> 00:05:36.702
ALLIANCE, BECAUSE THERE ARE NO
WARS AMONG NATO COUNTRIES, OR

00:05:36.702 --> 00:05:39.672
INSIDE NATO.
SO FOR US, THIS IS THE MOST

00:05:39.672 --> 00:05:46.212
SECURE CONSTRUCT.
BUT IF THAT PART IS LONGER THAN

00:05:46.212 --> 00:05:50.016
WE WOULD WANT TO BE,
UNFORTUNATELY DUE TO SOME

00:05:50.016 --> 00:05:53.886
PERSONAL ATTITUDES OF THE
LEADERS OF SOME COUNTRIES, I

00:05:53.886 --> 00:05:58.658
WOULD AGAIN LIKE TO STRESS THE
LEADERS, NOT THE SOCIETIES,

00:05:58.658 --> 00:06:01.026
BECAUSE ALL THE SOCIETIES
DEFINITELY SIDE WITH US.

00:06:01.026 --> 00:06:06.098
IF THAT PATH IS LONGER THAN WE
CAN AFFORD, THEN WHILE ON THIS

00:06:06.098 --> 00:06:10.636
PATH WE WOULD NEED SECURITY
GUARANTEES TO BE ABLE TO REACH

00:06:10.636 --> 00:06:14.674
NATO MEMBERSHIP.
BECAUSE EVERYONE KEEPS SAYING

00:06:14.674 --> 00:06:18.945
THAT THE DOOR TO NATO'S OPEN,
BUT WE NEED TO REACH THESE

00:06:18.945 --> 00:06:22.582
DOORS.
&gt;&gt; I'M GOING TO ASK YOU THIS,

00:06:22.582 --> 00:06:25.485
BECAUSE YOU WENT NOT SO MANY
MONTHS AGO TO THE CONGRESS.

00:06:25.485 --> 00:06:27.787
YOU ALSO MET WITH PRESIDENT
BIDEN.

00:06:27.787 --> 00:06:31.123
YOU MET WITH THE FIRST LADY.
YOU ACTUALLY SAID, WE NEED

00:06:31.123 --> 00:06:32.425
WEAPONS.
SEND US THE WEAPONS.

00:06:32.425 --> 00:06:39.332
DO YOU FEEL THAT YOU HAVE THE
WEAPONS NOW TO ACTUALLY WIN?

00:06:39.332 --> 00:06:46.138
DO YOU FEEL THAT NATO IS HERE
TO HELP YOU WIN, OR JUST TO

00:06:46.138 --> 00:06:52.078
STOP YOU FROM LOSING?
&gt;&gt; I THINK THE PRESIDENT KNOWS

00:06:52.078 --> 00:06:56.415
BETTER HOW MUCH MORE WE NEED.
I'M SURE WE NEED MUCH MORE, BUT

00:06:56.415 --> 00:07:00.419
AS A CITIZEN OF UKRAINE, AS A
MOTHER AND WIFE, I CAN FEEL

00:07:00.419 --> 00:07:03.556
THAT WE NEED IT BECAUSE THE
MUSCLES KEEP COMING.

00:07:03.556 --> 00:07:08.127
WHEN THEY STOP COMING, WHEN OUR
PEOPLE STOP DYING IN THEIR BEDS

00:07:08.127 --> 00:07:11.430
AND MORNING, I WILL FEEL OKAY
MAYBE THAT'S ENOUGH.

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:14.466
BUT WE CAN'T WAIT FOR RUSSIANS
TO RUN OUT OF THEIR SUPPLIES.

00:07:14.466 --> 00:07:18.504
IT WOULD BE WONDERFUL FOR THEM
TO RUN OUT, BUT I GUESS THAT IS

00:07:18.504 --> 00:07:21.440
FANTASY.
THAT IS WHY I ASKED TO PROTECT

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:25.378
OUR CHILDREN, TO PROTECT ALL OF
US.

00:07:25.378 --> 00:07:27.713
IT IS HARD TO LIVE UNDER THIS
BURDEN EVERY DAY WHEN YOU DON'T

00:07:27.713 --> 00:07:31.417
KNOW WHAT WILL HAPPEN TOMORROW,
WHEN THE MISSILES WILL HIT

00:07:31.417 --> 00:07:34.420
CROSSROADS WHILE PEOPLE ARE
DRIVING TO WORK AND GET KILLED

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:37.489
ON THE WAY.
THE OTHER PART OF THAT MISSILE

00:07:37.489 --> 00:07:40.927
HIT A CHILDREN'S PLAYGROUND IN
A PARK.

00:07:40.927 --> 00:07:43.729
I LITERALLY WALKED THERE WITH
MY CHILDREN WHEN THEY WERE

00:07:43.729 --> 00:07:47.366
YOUNG.
I'M REALLY HAPPY THAT IT WAS 8

00:07:47.366 --> 00:07:48.867
AM AND THERE WERE NO CHILDREN
YET.

00:07:48.867 --> 00:07:53.306
AND I'M HAPPY THAT MY CHILDREN
ARE --

00:07:53.306 --> 00:07:55.508
WERE NOT THERE.
BUT IT BRINGS IT CLOSER AND

00:07:55.508 --> 00:07:58.344
CLOSER.
SO THE QUESTIONS OF WEAPONS IS

00:07:58.344 --> 00:08:02.448
A QUESTION OF OUR SURVIVAL.
THE SURVIVAL OF OUR AND OUR --

00:08:02.448 --> 00:08:04.850
US AND OUR CHILDREN.
&gt;&gt; MISTER PRESIDENT, AFTER ALL

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:09.221
OF YOUR POWERFUL CALLS TO THE
WORLD FOR HELP, WEAPONRY MOST

00:08:09.221 --> 00:08:13.059
ESPECIALLY, TRAINING, ALL THAT
INTELLIGENCE HELP YOU'VE NEEDED,

00:08:13.059 --> 00:08:16.329
ARE THEY FINALLY DELIVERING
WHAT YOU NEED TO WIN?

00:08:16.329 --> 00:08:18.664
AND DO YOU FEEL LIKE YOU ARE
GETTING ENOUGH TO WIN, OR JUST

00:08:18.664 --> 00:08:24.904
NOT TO LOSE?
&gt;&gt; I THINK MY WIFE ANSWERED IT

00:08:24.904 --> 00:08:27.773
VERY WELL.
THE ANSWER IS FAIRLY SIMPLE.

00:08:27.773 --> 00:08:30.943
IT IS ENOUGH WHEN YOU CAN NO
LONGER HEAR EXPLOSIONS.

00:08:30.943 --> 00:08:35.815
IT'S ENOUGH WHEN THE AIR
DEFENSE SYSTEM ENSURES NO

00:08:35.815 --> 00:08:38.284
MISSILES HIT THE GROUND OR
BUILDINGS.

00:08:38.284 --> 00:08:42.922
IT IS ENOUGH WHEN YOU ARE NOT
BEING FIRED AT NO MISSILES ARE

00:08:42.922 --> 00:08:48.561
LAUNCHED AGAINST YOU.
BECAUSE RUSSIA IS WORKING

00:08:48.561 --> 00:08:50.896
TOGETHER WITH ITS PARTNER, IF I
MAY CALL THEM THAT, WITH IRAN.

00:08:50.896 --> 00:08:56.502
SINCE OCTOBER, WE HAVE SEEN THE
MUSE AROUND 450 KAMIKAZE DRONES,

00:08:56.502 --> 00:09:02.541
ATTACK DRONES, AND RECOGNIZANCE
ATTACK DRONES, KAMIKAZE DRONES,

00:09:02.541 --> 00:09:06.445
MISSILES.
OVER THIS TIME, WE'VE HAD OVER

00:09:06.445 --> 00:09:08.948
2500 HITS.
THAT'S WITHOUT ARTILLERY.

00:09:08.948 --> 00:09:14.820
2500 HITS BY DRONES, EXPLOSIVES,
OR MISSILES.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:18.858
THAT IS A LARGE NUMBER.
DO WE HAVE ENOUGH DEFENSES?

00:09:18.858 --> 00:09:20.726
NO, I DON'T THINK WE HAVE
ENOUGH AT ALL.

00:09:20.726 --> 00:09:26.032
IS IT ENOUGH TO MAKE 100 OR
1000 CALLS?

00:09:26.032 --> 00:09:30.736
PROBABLY NOT ENOUGH EITHER.
BUT I'M READY TO MAKE 1000

00:09:30.736 --> 00:09:34.507
CALLS IF EVERY CALL I MAKE
RESULTS IN MORE AIR DEFENSE

00:09:34.507 --> 00:09:37.777
SYSTEMS.
I'M READY TO STAY ON THE PHONE

00:09:37.777 --> 00:09:39.879
AND JUST DO THAT.
IT'S DIFFICULT.

00:09:39.879 --> 00:09:43.883
A JOINT DECISION ON THE
PROTECTION OF UKRAINE AND

00:09:43.883 --> 00:09:45.951
UKRAINIAN AIRSPACE WILL
DEFINITELY HELP US.

00:09:45.951 --> 00:09:50.823
AND ALL THE ANSWERS ARE THERE.
I'M SORRY, IT'S NOT EVEN LIKE

00:09:50.823 --> 00:09:54.160
THE START OF THE COVID
EPIDEMIC.

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:57.963
WHEN PEOPLE DID NOT KNOW WHAT
TO DO ABOUT IT, WHEN WE NEEDED

00:09:57.963 --> 00:10:02.802
TO CREATE THE VACCINE AND IT
DIDN'T EXIST.

00:10:02.802 --> 00:10:05.738
THERE IS A VACCINE AGAINST
RUSSIAN STRIKES AND WE KNOW IT.

00:10:05.738 --> 00:10:09.575
THERE IS A VACCINE AGAINST
RUSSIA AND WE KNOW EXACTLY

00:10:09.575 --> 00:10:13.212
WHICH COUNTRIES HAVE IT, AND IN
WHAT AMOUNT.

00:10:13.212 --> 00:10:18.784
AND I WOULD SAY FRANKLY, THERE
ARE EVEN COUNTRIES THAT HAVE A

00:10:18.784 --> 00:10:20.686
SURPLUS AMOUNT FROM MY POINT OF
VIEW.

00:10:20.686 --> 00:10:25.858
SO I GUESS IN ANSWER TO YOUR
QUESTION, THERE IS NOT ENOUGH

00:10:25.858 --> 00:10:27.059
WILLINGNESS I WOULD SAY.

